Package: sbom
Title: Software Bills of Materials for R Code
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("James", "Balamuta", email = "james.balamuta@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Generates Software Bills of Materials for R packages and R
    library installations, as 'CycloneDX' 1.4 to 1.7 (JSON or XML), 'SPDX'
    2.2 and 2.3 (JSON, YAML, XML or tag-value) and 'SPDX' 3.0.1 documents
    and 'SWID' tags, plus a CSV inventory of components for spreadsheet
    review.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
    cli (>= 3.6.0),
    jsonlite,
    utils,
    xml2
Suggests:
    jsonvalidate,
    testthat (>= 3.2.0),
    withr,
    yaml
Copyright: See file inst/COPYRIGHTS
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.1
